## Authority
This door holds the permission for the band. A member points. It does not repeat it.

```text
who: a Builder or Colab returns; the Prime reviews
may: one member per return record, linked to its pack
may not: accept its own result
```

## Members
None yet. Returns are files in `returns/` beside `packs/` (the Director, 2026-10-26). A member page here would record one.

## Not
